[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.270",
    "end": "00:00:02.640",
    "start_seconds": 0.27,
    "end_seconds": 2.64,
    "text": "- You're gonna learn how to communicate like a CEO"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:02.640",
    "end": "00:00:04.110",
    "start_seconds": 2.64,
    "end_seconds": 4.11,
    "text": "or other top leader."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.110",
    "end": "00:00:06.360",
    "start_seconds": 4.11,
    "end_seconds": 6.36,
    "text": "This is part three in a three-part series"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.360",
    "end": "00:00:08.070",
    "start_seconds": 6.36,
    "end_seconds": 8.07,
    "text": "on How to Become a Leader."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.070",
    "end": "00:00:09.600",
    "start_seconds": 8.07,
    "end_seconds": 9.6,
    "text": "And we've now worked our way up"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:09.600",
    "end": "00:00:14.220",
    "start_seconds": 9.6,
    "end_seconds": 14.22,
    "text": "to five ways CEOs communicate differently than frontline"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:14.220",
    "end": "00:00:15.870",
    "start_seconds": 14.22,
    "end_seconds": 15.87,
    "text": "or even mid-level leaders."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.870",
    "end": "00:00:17.460",
    "start_seconds": 15.87,
    "end_seconds": 17.46,
    "text": "The big overarching skill"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.460",
    "end": "00:00:19.320",
    "start_seconds": 17.46,
    "end_seconds": 19.32,
    "text": "that separates top leaders from the rest"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.320",
    "end": "00:00:22.500",
    "start_seconds": 19.32,
    "end_seconds": 22.5,
    "text": "is what leadership researcher Robert Katz describes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.500",
    "end": "00:00:26.190",
    "start_seconds": 22.5,
    "end_seconds": 26.19,
    "text": "as the ability to think and talk about the big picture."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.190",
    "end": "00:00:29.490",
    "start_seconds": 26.19,
    "end_seconds": 29.49,
    "text": "Compared to frontline supervisors or mid-level leaders,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.490",
    "end": "00:00:31.380",
    "start_seconds": 29.49,
    "end_seconds": 31.38,
    "text": "leaders at the highest levels must think"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:31.380",
    "end": "00:00:34.260",
    "start_seconds": 31.38,
    "end_seconds": 34.26,
    "text": "and speak about the entire organization."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:34.260",
    "end": "00:00:38.160",
    "start_seconds": 34.26,
    "end_seconds": 38.16,
    "text": "I'm talking about CEOs, presidents, the rest of the C-suite."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:38.160",
    "end": "00:00:39.510",
    "start_seconds": 38.16,
    "end_seconds": 39.51,
    "text": "But even if you're the founder"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.510",
    "end": "00:00:42.210",
    "start_seconds": 39.51,
    "end_seconds": 42.21,
    "text": "or owner of a small business with just a handful"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.210",
    "end": "00:00:45.180",
    "start_seconds": 42.21,
    "end_seconds": 45.18,
    "text": "of employees, you must do these five skills."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.180",
    "end": "00:00:46.320",
    "start_seconds": 45.18,
    "end_seconds": 46.32,
    "text": "Now, as you'll see,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.320",
    "end": "00:00:50.130",
    "start_seconds": 46.32,
    "end_seconds": 50.13,
    "text": "these five big picture communication skills are more complex"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:50.130",
    "end": "00:00:52.920",
    "start_seconds": 50.13,
    "end_seconds": 52.92,
    "text": "and demanding than most other communication skills."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.920",
    "end": "00:00:55.860",
    "start_seconds": 52.92,
    "end_seconds": 55.86,
    "text": "Rest assured, anybody can improve"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.860",
    "end": "00:00:58.260",
    "start_seconds": 55.86,
    "end_seconds": 58.26,
    "text": "with time, guidance, and effort."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.260",
    "end": "00:01:00.810",
    "start_seconds": 58.26,
    "end_seconds": 60.81,
    "text": "So use this video as a self-assessment"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.810",
    "end": "00:01:02.370",
    "start_seconds": 60.81,
    "end_seconds": 62.37,
    "text": "of what skills you're already good at"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.370",
    "end": "00:01:04.200",
    "start_seconds": 62.37,
    "end_seconds": 64.2,
    "text": "and the ones you wanna improve."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.200",
    "end": "00:01:07.860",
    "start_seconds": 64.2,
    "end_seconds": 67.86,
    "text": "The number one big picture way to communicate like a CEO"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.860",
    "end": "00:01:12.720",
    "start_seconds": 67.86,
    "end_seconds": 72.72,
    "text": "is to know and communicate the deeper meaning of work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.720",
    "end": "00:01:16.290",
    "start_seconds": 72.72,
    "end_seconds": 76.28999999999999,
    "text": "Many leaders and authors call this the why question."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:16.290",
    "end": "00:01:18.480",
    "start_seconds": 76.28999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 78.48,
    "text": "Even before they start an organization,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.480",
    "end": "00:01:22.410",
    "start_seconds": 78.48,
    "end_seconds": 82.41,
    "text": "founding leaders are driven by a clear purpose, a key reason"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.410",
    "end": "00:01:24.000",
    "start_seconds": 82.41,
    "end_seconds": 84.0,
    "text": "for doing what they're doing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.000",
    "end": "00:01:26.010",
    "start_seconds": 84.0,
    "end_seconds": 86.01,
    "text": "You'll see that spelled out in their vision"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26.010",
    "end": "00:01:29.490",
    "start_seconds": 86.01,
    "end_seconds": 89.49,
    "text": "and mission statements and big goals that they're chasing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:29.490",
    "end": "00:01:31.530",
    "start_seconds": 89.49,
    "end_seconds": 91.53,
    "text": "All these help provide the context"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.530",
    "end": "00:01:34.020",
    "start_seconds": 91.53,
    "end_seconds": 94.02000000000001,
    "text": "and the explanation to help everybody on the team understand"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.020",
    "end": "00:01:36.240",
    "start_seconds": 94.02000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 96.24000000000001,
    "text": "the deeper meaning of the work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.240",
    "end": "00:01:40.290",
    "start_seconds": 96.24000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 100.28999999999999,
    "text": "Now, it's true that some of those website vision statements"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.290",
    "end": "00:01:43.530",
    "start_seconds": 100.28999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 103.53,
    "text": "and mission statements sound like marketing points really,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.530",
    "end": "00:01:45.780",
    "start_seconds": 103.53,
    "end_seconds": 105.78,
    "text": "but I'm talking about the vision statements"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.780",
    "end": "00:01:47.370",
    "start_seconds": 105.78,
    "end_seconds": 107.37,
    "text": "that really hit home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.370",
    "end": "00:01:49.740",
    "start_seconds": 107.37,
    "end_seconds": 109.74000000000001,
    "text": "For example, what's the deeper meaning"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.740",
    "end": "00:01:51.390",
    "start_seconds": 109.74000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 111.39,
    "text": "that drives the Khan Academy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.390",
    "end": "00:01:54.210",
    "start_seconds": 111.39,
    "end_seconds": 114.21000000000001,
    "text": "to keep cranking out educational videos?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.210",
    "end": "00:01:57.390",
    "start_seconds": 114.21000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 117.39,
    "text": "The founder, Sal Khan, he has a why"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.390",
    "end": "00:01:59.340",
    "start_seconds": 117.39,
    "end_seconds": 119.34,
    "text": "and that is to provide a free"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.340",
    "end": "00:02:03.750",
    "start_seconds": 119.34,
    "end_seconds": 123.75,
    "text": "and world class education to anyone anywhere."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.750",
    "end": "00:02:06.000",
    "start_seconds": 123.75,
    "end_seconds": 126.0,
    "text": "It's his reason for being."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.000",
    "end": "00:02:10.050",
    "start_seconds": 126.0,
    "end_seconds": 130.05,
    "text": "Those employees are not simply recording and editing videos."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.050",
    "end": "00:02:12.540",
    "start_seconds": 130.05,
    "end_seconds": 132.54,
    "text": "The deeper meaning they all have in mind"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.540",
    "end": "00:02:15.780",
    "start_seconds": 132.54,
    "end_seconds": 135.78,
    "text": "is that they wanna educate the world, and that's powerful."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.780",
    "end": "00:02:18.480",
    "start_seconds": 135.78,
    "end_seconds": 138.48,
    "text": "It's the CEO's job to communicate that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.480",
    "end": "00:02:19.560",
    "start_seconds": 138.48,
    "end_seconds": 139.56,
    "text": "For our self-assessment,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:19.560",
    "end": "00:02:22.410",
    "start_seconds": 139.56,
    "end_seconds": 142.41,
    "text": "on a scale of one to 10, how good are you at seeing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.410",
    "end": "00:02:25.710",
    "start_seconds": 142.41,
    "end_seconds": 145.71,
    "text": "and articulating the big picture deeper meaning of work?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.710",
    "end": "00:02:28.680",
    "start_seconds": 145.71,
    "end_seconds": 148.68,
    "text": "Top leaders must be the number one advocate"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.680",
    "end": "00:02:31.680",
    "start_seconds": 148.68,
    "end_seconds": 151.68,
    "text": "to communicate the deeper meaning of work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.680",
    "end": "00:02:34.290",
    "start_seconds": 151.68,
    "end_seconds": 154.29,
    "text": "The number two way that CEOs communicate"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.290",
    "end": "00:02:35.550",
    "start_seconds": 154.29,
    "end_seconds": 155.55,
    "text": "is that they must inspire"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.550",
    "end": "00:02:38.817",
    "start_seconds": 155.55,
    "end_seconds": 158.817,
    "text": "and motivate others to achieve great things together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.817",
    "end": "00:02:41.850",
    "start_seconds": 158.817,
    "end_seconds": 161.85,
    "text": "And we all need individual inspiration and motivation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:41.850",
    "end": "00:02:45.180",
    "start_seconds": 161.85,
    "end_seconds": 165.18,
    "text": "That's true, but the CEO or the President must get us"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.180",
    "end": "00:02:47.730",
    "start_seconds": 165.18,
    "end_seconds": 167.73,
    "text": "to work as one big team together"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.730",
    "end": "00:02:49.230",
    "start_seconds": 167.73,
    "end_seconds": 169.23,
    "text": "and show us that we're all part"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.230",
    "end": "00:02:51.240",
    "start_seconds": 169.23,
    "end_seconds": 171.24,
    "text": "of something bigger than ourselves."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.240",
    "end": "00:02:54.450",
    "start_seconds": 171.24,
    "end_seconds": 174.45,
    "text": "That's why when JFK gave his moonshot speech,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.450",
    "end": "00:02:57.720",
    "start_seconds": 174.45,
    "end_seconds": 177.72,
    "text": "he was explicit about who would be accomplishing this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.720",
    "end": "00:03:01.140",
    "start_seconds": 177.72,
    "end_seconds": 181.14,
    "text": "He said, \"I believe this nation should commit itself"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.140",
    "end": "00:03:02.220",
    "start_seconds": 181.14,
    "end_seconds": 182.22,
    "text": "to achieving the goal"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.220",
    "end": "00:03:06.150",
    "start_seconds": 182.22,
    "end_seconds": 186.15,
    "text": "before this decade is out of landing a man on the moon"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.150",
    "end": "00:03:09.150",
    "start_seconds": 186.15,
    "end_seconds": 189.15,
    "text": "and returning him safely to the Earth.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.150",
    "end": "00:03:12.870",
    "start_seconds": 189.15,
    "end_seconds": 192.87,
    "text": "He didn't say, for example, in my presidency or NASA"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.870",
    "end": "00:03:16.320",
    "start_seconds": 192.87,
    "end_seconds": 196.32,
    "text": "or astronauts, he said, \"This nation.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.320",
    "end": "00:03:20.190",
    "start_seconds": 196.32,
    "end_seconds": 200.19,
    "text": "He's saying, we, together, we are going to do this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.190",
    "end": "00:03:21.390",
    "start_seconds": 200.19,
    "end_seconds": 201.39,
    "text": "Now we create organizations"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.390",
    "end": "00:03:24.690",
    "start_seconds": 201.39,
    "end_seconds": 204.69,
    "text": "because individuals can't do these things alone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.690",
    "end": "00:03:27.750",
    "start_seconds": 204.69,
    "end_seconds": 207.75,
    "text": "And when Neil Armstrong put his feet on the moon finally"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.750",
    "end": "00:03:30.600",
    "start_seconds": 207.75,
    "end_seconds": 210.6,
    "text": "for the first time before the end of the decade,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.600",
    "end": "00:03:33.270",
    "start_seconds": 210.6,
    "end_seconds": 213.27,
    "text": "he was speaking from that same mindset."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.270",
    "end": "00:03:35.940",
    "start_seconds": 213.27,
    "end_seconds": 215.94,
    "text": "He didn't even say, \"This is a victory for America.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.940",
    "end": "00:03:39.390",
    "start_seconds": 215.94,
    "end_seconds": 219.39,
    "text": "He said, \"It was a giant leap for mankind.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.390",
    "end": "00:03:41.760",
    "start_seconds": 219.39,
    "end_seconds": 221.76,
    "text": "He was saying, we did this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.760",
    "end": "00:03:45.570",
    "start_seconds": 221.76,
    "end_seconds": 225.57,
    "text": "And in response, literally, the entire planet celebrated."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:45.570",
    "end": "00:03:47.730",
    "start_seconds": 225.57,
    "end_seconds": 227.73,
    "text": "In more everyday, practical ways,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.730",
    "end": "00:03:50.280",
    "start_seconds": 227.73,
    "end_seconds": 230.28,
    "text": "I've heard numerous top leaders inspire"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.280",
    "end": "00:03:52.470",
    "start_seconds": 230.28,
    "end_seconds": 232.47,
    "text": "and motivate others to achieve great things together"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.470",
    "end": "00:03:54.450",
    "start_seconds": 232.47,
    "end_seconds": 234.45,
    "text": "by telling success stories"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.450",
    "end": "00:03:56.850",
    "start_seconds": 234.45,
    "end_seconds": 236.85,
    "text": "or stories about humble beginnings"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.850",
    "end": "00:03:58.950",
    "start_seconds": 236.85,
    "end_seconds": 238.95,
    "text": "and how far we've come together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.950",
    "end": "00:04:00.630",
    "start_seconds": 238.95,
    "end_seconds": 240.63,
    "text": "I've been working with the president"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.630",
    "end": "00:04:01.860",
    "start_seconds": 240.63,
    "end_seconds": 241.86,
    "text": "of a billion dollar company"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.860",
    "end": "00:04:05.820",
    "start_seconds": 241.86,
    "end_seconds": 245.82,
    "text": "and he tells stories all the time about how we,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.820",
    "end": "00:04:08.730",
    "start_seconds": 245.82,
    "end_seconds": 248.73,
    "text": "the company, grew from less than 25 employees"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.730",
    "end": "00:04:10.680",
    "start_seconds": 248.73,
    "end_seconds": 250.68,
    "text": "to over 1,000 employees,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.680",
    "end": "00:04:12.510",
    "start_seconds": 250.68,
    "end_seconds": 252.51,
    "text": "and that each of those employees is part"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.510",
    "end": "00:04:14.820",
    "start_seconds": 252.51,
    "end_seconds": 254.82,
    "text": "of that success and legacy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.820",
    "end": "00:04:16.440",
    "start_seconds": 254.82,
    "end_seconds": 256.44,
    "text": "He doesn't inspire and motivate us"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.440",
    "end": "00:04:18.360",
    "start_seconds": 256.44,
    "end_seconds": 258.36,
    "text": "by talking about how he did it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.360",
    "end": "00:04:21.930",
    "start_seconds": 258.36,
    "end_seconds": 261.93,
    "text": "He talks genuinely about how we all did it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.930",
    "end": "00:04:23.490",
    "start_seconds": 261.93,
    "end_seconds": 263.49,
    "text": "Question for you from one to 10,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:23.490",
    "end": "00:04:24.990",
    "start_seconds": 263.49,
    "end_seconds": 264.99,
    "text": "how good are you at inspiring"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.990",
    "end": "00:04:27.300",
    "start_seconds": 264.99,
    "end_seconds": 267.3,
    "text": "and motivating people to work as a team"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.300",
    "end": "00:04:29.820",
    "start_seconds": 267.3,
    "end_seconds": 269.82,
    "text": "to achieve great things together?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.820",
    "end": "00:04:33.150",
    "start_seconds": 269.82,
    "end_seconds": 273.15,
    "text": "Now, it's a bonus if you're in the mid-level management area"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.150",
    "end": "00:04:34.710",
    "start_seconds": 273.15,
    "end_seconds": 274.71,
    "text": "or frontline supervisor area,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.710",
    "end": "00:04:38.880",
    "start_seconds": 274.71,
    "end_seconds": 278.88,
    "text": "and you already talk like this, but top leaders must do it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.880",
    "end": "00:04:41.490",
    "start_seconds": 278.88,
    "end_seconds": 281.49,
    "text": "Number three is that the CEO must know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.490",
    "end": "00:04:43.350",
    "start_seconds": 281.49,
    "end_seconds": 283.35,
    "text": "and talk about how the various parts"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.350",
    "end": "00:04:45.870",
    "start_seconds": 283.35,
    "end_seconds": 285.87,
    "text": "of the organization work together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:45.870",
    "end": "00:04:48.000",
    "start_seconds": 285.87,
    "end_seconds": 288.0,
    "text": "Individual contributors in contrast,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.000",
    "end": "00:04:49.950",
    "start_seconds": 288.0,
    "end_seconds": 289.95,
    "text": "talk mostly about their own expertise,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.950",
    "end": "00:04:52.770",
    "start_seconds": 289.95,
    "end_seconds": 292.77,
    "text": "department and division leaders talk about their shops,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.770",
    "end": "00:04:55.050",
    "start_seconds": 292.77,
    "end_seconds": 295.05,
    "text": "but the top leaders must talk about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.050",
    "end": "00:04:57.960",
    "start_seconds": 295.05,
    "end_seconds": 297.96,
    "text": "how the entire enterprise works together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.960",
    "end": "00:04:59.940",
    "start_seconds": 297.96,
    "end_seconds": 299.94,
    "text": "Now, maybe that leader rose through the ranks"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.940",
    "end": "00:05:03.210",
    "start_seconds": 299.94,
    "end_seconds": 303.21,
    "text": "and came up through IT or operations or finance,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:03.210",
    "end": "00:05:06.990",
    "start_seconds": 303.21,
    "end_seconds": 306.99,
    "text": "but once they're the top leader, the CEO, the president,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:06.990",
    "end": "00:05:09.420",
    "start_seconds": 306.99,
    "end_seconds": 309.42,
    "text": "they're now leading all of those areas"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.420",
    "end": "00:05:10.470",
    "start_seconds": 309.42,
    "end_seconds": 310.47,
    "text": "and they must talk in ways"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.470",
    "end": "00:05:12.870",
    "start_seconds": 310.47,
    "end_seconds": 312.87,
    "text": "that help everybody see the organization"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.870",
    "end": "00:05:15.300",
    "start_seconds": 312.87,
    "end_seconds": 315.3,
    "text": "and those different parts working, coordinating,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.300",
    "end": "00:05:16.830",
    "start_seconds": 315.3,
    "end_seconds": 316.83,
    "text": "and cooperating together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.830",
    "end": "00:05:19.680",
    "start_seconds": 316.83,
    "end_seconds": 319.68,
    "text": "As organizations grow, they quickly separate"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.680",
    "end": "00:05:21.420",
    "start_seconds": 319.68,
    "end_seconds": 321.42,
    "text": "into what we call silos."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.420",
    "end": "00:05:23.760",
    "start_seconds": 321.42,
    "end_seconds": 323.76,
    "text": "On a farm, you keep the corn in one silo"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.760",
    "end": "00:05:26.970",
    "start_seconds": 323.76,
    "end_seconds": 326.97,
    "text": "and the wheat in another silo so they don't mix."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:26.970",
    "end": "00:05:28.440",
    "start_seconds": 326.97,
    "end_seconds": 328.44,
    "text": "And that's what happens in organizations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.440",
    "end": "00:05:29.910",
    "start_seconds": 328.44,
    "end_seconds": 329.91,
    "text": "They silo themselves"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.910",
    "end": "00:05:33.540",
    "start_seconds": 329.91,
    "end_seconds": 333.54,
    "text": "and stop sharing information, resources, talent."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:33.540",
    "end": "00:05:34.590",
    "start_seconds": 333.54,
    "end_seconds": 334.59000000000003,
    "text": "But top leaders know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.590",
    "end": "00:05:37.170",
    "start_seconds": 334.59000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 337.17,
    "text": "that organizations work best when they are running"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:37.170",
    "end": "00:05:40.080",
    "start_seconds": 337.17,
    "end_seconds": 340.08,
    "text": "like interconnected, interdependent systems"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.080",
    "end": "00:05:42.840",
    "start_seconds": 340.08,
    "end_seconds": 342.84000000000003,
    "text": "where the subparts talk to each other more openly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.840",
    "end": "00:05:45.090",
    "start_seconds": 342.84000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 345.09000000000003,
    "text": "and work together more freely."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:45.090",
    "end": "00:05:48.223",
    "start_seconds": 345.09000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 348.223,
    "text": "Question for you, how skilled are you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.223",
    "end": "00:05:49.056",
    "start_seconds": 348.223,
    "end_seconds": 349.056,
    "text": "from one to 10, at understanding"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:49.056",
    "end": "00:05:51.720",
    "start_seconds": 349.056,
    "end_seconds": 351.72,
    "text": "and talking about how all of the various parts"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:51.720",
    "end": "00:05:54.120",
    "start_seconds": 351.72,
    "end_seconds": 354.12,
    "text": "of the organization work together?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.120",
    "end": "00:05:56.970",
    "start_seconds": 354.12,
    "end_seconds": 356.97,
    "text": "The top leaders are really the only individuals position"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:56.970",
    "end": "00:05:58.440",
    "start_seconds": 356.97,
    "end_seconds": 358.44,
    "text": "for this responsibility,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.440",
    "end": "00:06:01.110",
    "start_seconds": 358.44,
    "end_seconds": 361.11,
    "text": "and that's why they must be the ones to talk about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:01.110",
    "end": "00:06:02.850",
    "start_seconds": 361.11,
    "end_seconds": 362.85,
    "text": "how all the parts work together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:02.850",
    "end": "00:06:05.250",
    "start_seconds": 362.85,
    "end_seconds": 365.25,
    "text": "Now, I've seen very few popular videos"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:05.250",
    "end": "00:06:06.690",
    "start_seconds": 365.25,
    "end_seconds": 366.69,
    "text": "and mainstream articles written"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.690",
    "end": "00:06:10.110",
    "start_seconds": 366.69,
    "end_seconds": 370.11,
    "text": "about the next two CEO skills, but they're often"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.110",
    "end": "00:06:13.620",
    "start_seconds": 370.11,
    "end_seconds": 373.62,
    "text": "what help organizations succeed in the long run."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.620",
    "end": "00:06:16.350",
    "start_seconds": 373.62,
    "end_seconds": 376.35,
    "text": "Number four is that the CEO must engage"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:16.350",
    "end": "00:06:19.470",
    "start_seconds": 376.35,
    "end_seconds": 379.47,
    "text": "in environmental scanning and sense-making"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.470",
    "end": "00:06:21.300",
    "start_seconds": 379.47,
    "end_seconds": 381.3,
    "text": "for their organization."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.300",
    "end": "00:06:22.200",
    "start_seconds": 381.3,
    "end_seconds": 382.2,
    "text": "The first half of this"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:22.200",
    "end": "00:06:24.180",
    "start_seconds": 382.2,
    "end_seconds": 384.18,
    "text": "is what we call environmental scanning."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.180",
    "end": "00:06:26.850",
    "start_seconds": 384.18,
    "end_seconds": 386.85,
    "text": "That's when the top leaders deliberately look"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.850",
    "end": "00:06:29.820",
    "start_seconds": 386.85,
    "end_seconds": 389.82,
    "text": "at external variables that can influence the organization"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:29.820",
    "end": "00:06:33.240",
    "start_seconds": 389.82,
    "end_seconds": 393.24,
    "text": "like market trends, government policy changes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:33.240",
    "end": "00:06:37.170",
    "start_seconds": 393.24,
    "end_seconds": 397.17,
    "text": "competitors' activities, innovations and technology changes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:37.170",
    "end": "00:06:40.110",
    "start_seconds": 397.17,
    "end_seconds": 400.11,
    "text": "demographic changes, many other external variables."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:40.110",
    "end": "00:06:42.390",
    "start_seconds": 400.11,
    "end_seconds": 402.39,
    "text": "They must also track internal variables"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:42.390",
    "end": "00:06:46.110",
    "start_seconds": 402.39,
    "end_seconds": 406.11,
    "text": "like workplace morale and satisfaction, employee turnover,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.110",
    "end": "00:06:48.450",
    "start_seconds": 406.11,
    "end_seconds": 408.45,
    "text": "and other measures of success."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:48.450",
    "end": "00:06:50.820",
    "start_seconds": 408.45,
    "end_seconds": 410.82,
    "text": "Top leaders must scan for changes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:50.820",
    "end": "00:06:53.760",
    "start_seconds": 410.82,
    "end_seconds": 413.76,
    "text": "and then help the organization adapt to those changes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:53.760",
    "end": "00:06:55.950",
    "start_seconds": 413.76,
    "end_seconds": 415.95,
    "text": "so they're not caught on their back foot"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:55.950",
    "end": "00:06:57.900",
    "start_seconds": 415.95,
    "end_seconds": 417.9,
    "text": "falling behind the industry."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.900",
    "end": "00:07:00.930",
    "start_seconds": 417.9,
    "end_seconds": 420.93,
    "text": "The second half of environmental scanning is making sense"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.930",
    "end": "00:07:04.530",
    "start_seconds": 420.93,
    "end_seconds": 424.53,
    "text": "of those or interpreting these factors for employees,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.530",
    "end": "00:07:07.380",
    "start_seconds": 424.53,
    "end_seconds": 427.38,
    "text": "and this should not be spin or public relations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:07.380",
    "end": "00:07:09.540",
    "start_seconds": 427.38,
    "end_seconds": 429.54,
    "text": "The CEO's perspective should be an honest"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:09.540",
    "end": "00:07:12.840",
    "start_seconds": 429.54,
    "end_seconds": 432.84,
    "text": "and helpful sense-making process of what's happening"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.840",
    "end": "00:07:15.480",
    "start_seconds": 432.84,
    "end_seconds": 435.48,
    "text": "around the organization and in the organization."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:15.480",
    "end": "00:07:16.830",
    "start_seconds": 435.48,
    "end_seconds": 436.83,
    "text": "Are tariffs going up?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:16.830",
    "end": "00:07:18.120",
    "start_seconds": 436.83,
    "end_seconds": 438.12,
    "text": "How's that going to affect us?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:18.120",
    "end": "00:07:20.430",
    "start_seconds": 438.12,
    "end_seconds": 440.43,
    "text": "Another pizza place opened across the street."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:20.430",
    "end": "00:07:22.590",
    "start_seconds": 440.43,
    "end_seconds": 442.59,
    "text": "What does that mean for ours?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:22.590",
    "end": "00:07:25.530",
    "start_seconds": 442.59,
    "end_seconds": 445.53,
    "text": "Three of our top people left, what do we do now?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:25.530",
    "end": "00:07:29.070",
    "start_seconds": 445.53,
    "end_seconds": 449.07,
    "text": "From one to 10, how would you rate yourself in your ability"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:29.070",
    "end": "00:07:31.860",
    "start_seconds": 449.07,
    "end_seconds": 451.86,
    "text": "to scan the environment and interpret those changes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:31.860",
    "end": "00:07:33.960",
    "start_seconds": 451.86,
    "end_seconds": 453.96,
    "text": "and how they'll affect your team?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:33.960",
    "end": "00:07:35.520",
    "start_seconds": 453.96,
    "end_seconds": 455.52,
    "text": "Followers want to hear"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:35.520",
    "end": "00:07:38.250",
    "start_seconds": 455.52,
    "end_seconds": 458.25,
    "text": "what the top leaders think about those changes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:38.250",
    "end": "00:07:39.630",
    "start_seconds": 458.25,
    "end_seconds": 459.63,
    "text": "what they see coming,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.630",
    "end": "00:07:42.150",
    "start_seconds": 459.63,
    "end_seconds": 462.15,
    "text": "and what top leaders plan to do about it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:42.150",
    "end": "00:07:44.400",
    "start_seconds": 462.15,
    "end_seconds": 464.4,
    "text": "Number five, CEOs must communicate effectively"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:44.400",
    "end": "00:07:46.680",
    "start_seconds": 464.4,
    "end_seconds": 466.68,
    "text": "with external stakeholders."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:46.680",
    "end": "00:07:49.410",
    "start_seconds": 466.68,
    "end_seconds": 469.40999999999997,
    "text": "Organizations are not isolated entities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:49.410",
    "end": "00:07:52.290",
    "start_seconds": 469.40999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 472.29,
    "text": "They are connected to other organizations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:52.290",
    "end": "00:07:55.290",
    "start_seconds": 472.29,
    "end_seconds": 475.29,
    "text": "CEOs are positioned at least at first to work best"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:55.290",
    "end": "00:07:58.260",
    "start_seconds": 475.29,
    "end_seconds": 478.26,
    "text": "with suppliers, vendors, local, federal"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:58.260",
    "end": "00:08:02.220",
    "start_seconds": 478.26,
    "end_seconds": 482.22,
    "text": "and government agencies, potential partner organizations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:02.220",
    "end": "00:08:04.470",
    "start_seconds": 482.22,
    "end_seconds": 484.47,
    "text": "When you see travel websites, for example."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:04.470",
    "end": "00:08:07.440",
    "start_seconds": 484.47,
    "end_seconds": 487.44,
    "text": "Airlines, hotels, car rental agencies, all working together,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:07.440",
    "end": "00:08:09.060",
    "start_seconds": 487.44,
    "end_seconds": 489.06,
    "text": "that's not an accident."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:09.060",
    "end": "00:08:11.910",
    "start_seconds": 489.06,
    "end_seconds": 491.91,
    "text": "That's the result of top leaders doing their best"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:11.910",
    "end": "00:08:14.220",
    "start_seconds": 491.91,
    "end_seconds": 494.22,
    "text": "to create collaborative relationships."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:14.220",
    "end": "00:08:17.520",
    "start_seconds": 494.22,
    "end_seconds": 497.52,
    "text": "Those relationships should be based on mutual benefits"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:17.520",
    "end": "00:08:19.080",
    "start_seconds": 497.52,
    "end_seconds": 499.08,
    "text": "and a fair exchange of value"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:19.080",
    "end": "00:08:21.390",
    "start_seconds": 499.08,
    "end_seconds": 501.39,
    "text": "between those external stakeholders."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:21.390",
    "end": "00:08:23.070",
    "start_seconds": 501.39,
    "end_seconds": 503.07,
    "text": "Small organizations do this too,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:23.070",
    "end": "00:08:24.810",
    "start_seconds": 503.07,
    "end_seconds": 504.81,
    "text": "but in more straightforward ways."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:24.810",
    "end": "00:08:27.900",
    "start_seconds": 504.81,
    "end_seconds": 507.9,
    "text": "I have a small business that's wrapped around this channel"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:27.900",
    "end": "00:08:31.050",
    "start_seconds": 507.9,
    "end_seconds": 511.05,
    "text": "where I work with website people, video, editors,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:31.050",
    "end": "00:08:34.530",
    "start_seconds": 511.05,
    "end_seconds": 514.53,
    "text": "social media managers, sponsors, an accounting firm."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:34.530",
    "end": "00:08:37.020",
    "start_seconds": 514.53,
    "end_seconds": 517.02,
    "text": "I do workshops for client organizations"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:37.020",
    "end": "00:08:39.120",
    "start_seconds": 517.02,
    "end_seconds": 519.12,
    "text": "and coach top corporate leaders."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:39.120",
    "end": "00:08:42.030",
    "start_seconds": 519.12,
    "end_seconds": 522.03,
    "text": "It's part of my job to make sure we're all getting"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:42.030",
    "end": "00:08:44.820",
    "start_seconds": 522.03,
    "end_seconds": 524.82,
    "text": "what we want out of these relationships."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:44.820",
    "end": "00:08:47.280",
    "start_seconds": 524.82,
    "end_seconds": 527.28,
    "text": "From one to 10, how skilled are you at collaborating"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:47.280",
    "end": "00:08:49.320",
    "start_seconds": 527.28,
    "end_seconds": 529.32,
    "text": "with external stakeholders?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:49.320",
    "end": "00:08:50.940",
    "start_seconds": 529.32,
    "end_seconds": 530.94,
    "text": "Working with external stakeholders"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:50.940",
    "end": "00:08:52.595",
    "start_seconds": 530.94,
    "end_seconds": 532.595,
    "text": "should elevate everybody's business"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:52.595",
    "end": "00:08:55.980",
